      "body": "Krishna Capital & Securities Limited announced a private placement to issue 30,000,000 shares at an issue price of INR 20 per share for gross proceeds of INR 600,000,000 on March 26, 2026. The transaction will include participation from new investors Ashu Jagmalaram Bishnoi 8,000,000 shares, Yagnik Bharatkumar Tank 15,500,000 shares, Rohankumar Hasmukhbhai Desai 3,000,000 shares, Chhayaben Rohankumar Desai Non-Promoter 3,000,000 shares and Rameshbhai shambhubhai Bhalala 500,000 shares. The transaction has been approved by shareholders and is subject to general shareholders to be held on April 25, 2026.",
