      "title": "Krishna Capital & Securities Limited Announces Management Changes, Effective February 27, 2026",
      "body": "Krishna Capital & Securities Limited, at its board meeting held on February 27, 2026, approved the appointment of Mr. Raj Kishorkumar Gajjar as Key Managerial Personnel (KMP) of the Company with effect from 27th February 2026. The Board approved the change in designation of Mr. Vinodkumar Agrawal from Executive Director to Non-Executive Director of the Company with effect from February 27, 2026 and pass the necessary resolution. The Board approved the re-constitution of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, Audit Committee, and Stakeholder Relationship Committee with effect from February 27, 2026 revised compositions as per applicable laws. Constitution of Various Committees are as: Kalpesh Mehta is the Chairman of the Nomination & Remuneration Committee, Mrs. Meenu Maheshwari is a Me",
