      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.10 (vs ₹0.02 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.10 (up from ₹0.02 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.23m (up 43% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹315.0k (up 235% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 26% (up from 11% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 72 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
